89
00:05:34,090 --> 00:05:38,260
Sylvan and Huntington focus on
assessment-based tutoring and test results.

90
00:05:38,710 --> 00:05:42,170
Best Brains provides small-group
Language Arts instruction.

91
00:05:43,820 --> 00:05:46,450
JEI also has important strengths.

92
00:05:46,900 --> 00:05:49,893
These include small-step
learning, a spiral curriculum,

93
00:05:49,947 --> 00:05:52,940
