114
00:07:15,840 --> 00:07:18,070
We also conducted a SWOT analysis.

115
00:07:18,520 --> 00:07:21,770
First, JEI has several internal strengths.

116
00:07:22,220 --> 00:07:26,810
Our precise assessment system allows us to
provide personalized learning roadmaps.

117
00:07:27,260 --> 00:07:30,044
Our learning content is
based on JEI's educational

118
00:07:30,100 --> 00:07:32,550
philosophy and programmed
learning approach.

119
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:35,890
It follows a small-step and
spiral learning structure.

120
00:07:36,340 --> 00:07:39,117
This structure helps
students learn independently

121
00:07:39,173 --> 00:07:41,270
