children have improved.

126
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:58,014
Looking at external
opportunities, demand for

127
00:07:58,070 --> 00:08:00,660
literacy and personalized
learning is growing.

128
00:08:01,110 --> 00:08:04,090
AI and digital education
are also expanding.

129
00:08:04,540 --> 00:08:06,724
As a result, parents increasingly expect

130
00:08:06,778 --> 00:08:09,180
