through clear data.

131
00:08:10,830 --> 00:08:15,210
At the same time, strong competitors with
well-known brands remain a challenge.

132
00:08:15,660 --> 00:08:19,560
Competition based on price and
convenience is another possible risk.

133
00:08:21,210 --> 00:08:24,720
Based on this analysis, we want
to strengthen JEI's position by

134
00:08:24,776 --> 00:08:28,509
connecting our assessment and
learning system with literacy-focused

135
00:08:28,564 --> 00:08:32,130
learning, Adaptive personalization,
and clear progress tracking.

136
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:36,358
Based on the Ansoff
Matrix, we believe product

137
00:08:36,412 --> 00:08:38,620
