learning through a fixed learning path.

171
00:10:37,920 --> 00:10:39,690
Kumon is in the third quadrant.

172
00:10:40,140 --> 00:10:43,270
It uses assessment to identify
a suitable starting point.

173
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:46,233
Students then follow a
set learning path, with

174
00:10:46,288 --> 00:10:48,910
