each student's pace.

178
00:10:59,570 --> 00:11:02,681
It is becoming more important to
understand each student's learning

179
00:11:02,727 --> 00:11:06,070
needs accurately and change what they
learn next based on their results.

180
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:10,100
Therefore, our goal is to move JEI English

181
00:11:10,157 --> 00:11:12,820
