to the first quadrant.

182
00:11:13,270 --> 00:11:15,577
We want to use precise
assessment to identify

183
00:11:15,629 --> 00:11:18,090
each student's current
level and learning needs.

184
00:11:18,540 --> 00:11:20,873
We will then continue
to adjust personalized

185
00:11:20,926 --> 00:11:23,100
learning paths based on learning results.

186
00:11:23,550 --> 00:11:27,590
Finally, we want to clearly show
how much each student has improved.

187
00:11:29,240 --> 00:11:30,530
This is what we mean by:

188
00:11:31,080 --> 00:11:32,980
Accurate Assessment, Clear Growth.

189
00:11:33,630 --> 00:11:37,206
We aim to make precise assessment,
personalized Adaptive Learning,

190
00:11:37,260 --> 00:11:40,620
and clear progress tracking one
connected learning experience.

191
00:11:41,070 --> 00:11:44,630
This will be the key position
of the new JEI English program.

192
00:11:46,380 --> 00:11:48,874
We reviewed the customer
journey from first

193
