development more efficient.

223
00:13:46,840 --> 00:13:50,762
Our goal is to develop a new JEI
English program that builds literacy

224
00:13:50,819 --> 00:13:54,230
skills through precise assessment
and personalized learning.

225
00:13:54,680 --> 00:13:56,893
As we explained earlier,
this is not simply

226
